<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Asakura Yoshikage</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1533">1533</a>–<a href="/years/1573">1573</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Asakura Yoshikage was the last Asakura lord of Echizen. He sheltered the future <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shogun">shogun</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ashikaga-yoshiaki">Ashikaga Yoshiaki</a> and allied with the Azai against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oda-nobunaga">Oda Nobunaga</a>, sharing their defeat at Anegawa in 1570. When Nobunaga invaded in 1573 and burned <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ichijodani">Ichijōdani</a>, Yoshikage was forced to kill himself.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/asakura-yoshikage.jpg" alt="Asakura Yoshikage" width="320" height="598" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: 投稿者がファイル作成 · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Asakura_Yoshikage2.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
